{"n":104,"name":"الهمزة","nameEn":"Al-Humazah","meaning":"The Traducer","revealed":"Makkah","ayahs":9,"translation":"Mufti Taqi Usmani","verses":[{"n":1,"ar":"وَيۡلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةِۙ‏","en":"Woe to every backbiter, derider"},{"n":2,"ar":"اِۨلَّذِيۡ جَمَعَ مَالًا وَّعَدَّدَهٗۙ‏","en":"who accumulates wealth and counts it."},{"n":3,"ar":"يَحۡسَبُ اَنَّ مَالَهٗ٘ اَخۡلَدَهٗۚ‏","en":"He thinks that his wealth has made him eternal."},{"n":4,"ar":"كَلَّا لَيُنۭۡ بَذَنَّ فِي الۡحُطَمَةِؗۖ‏","en":"Never! He will certainly be thrown into the Crushing Fire."},{"n":5,"ar":"وَمَا٘ اَدۡرٰىكَ مَا الۡحُطَمَةُؕ‏","en":"And what may let you know what the Crushing Fire is?"},{"n":6,"ar":"نَارُ اللّٰهِ الۡمُوۡقَدَةُۙ‏","en":"It is Allah’s kindled fire"},{"n":7,"ar":"الَّتِيۡ تَطَّلِعُ عَلَي الۡاَفۡـِٕدَةِؕ‏","en":"that will peep into the hearts."},{"n":8,"ar":"اِنَّهَا عَلَيۡهِمۡ مُّؤۡصَدَةٌۙ‏","en":"It will be closed on them,"},{"n":9,"ar":"فِيۡ عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍࣖ‏","en":"in outstretched columns."}]}